        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for python-jwcrypto",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for python-jwcrypto fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-92091: `JWK.import_key()` validates the `key_ops` JWK member for duplicate values using a quadratic\n  complexity algorithm, which allows attackers to cause a denial of service via excessive resource consumption\n  (bsc#1280816).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
